{"id":"f3e4e60b1fa0eaf2","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-comb8-ramsey-homogeneous-set.md","title":"ZFC Comb8 Ramsey Homogeneous Set","display":"df-zfc-comb8-ramsey-homogeneous-set — ZFC Comb8 Ramsey Homogeneous Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb8-ramsey-homogeneous-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb8-ramsey-homogeneous-set"],"display":"df-zfc-comb8-ramsey-homogeneous-set — ZFC Comb8 Ramsey Homogeneous Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-homogeneous]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb8-ramsey-homogeneous-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-ramsey-homogeneous-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb8-ramsey-homogeneous-set — ZFC Comb8 Ramsey Homogeneous Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1ae7c37b2bb25594\" href=\"?note=1ae7c37b2bb25594\" title=\"58-df-homogeneous\">58-df-homogeneous</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n,q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> (arity and number of colors)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> (cardinal)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in q^{[\\lambda]^n}\">\\(c\\in q^{[\\lambda]^n}\\)</span> (coloring)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\lambda\">\\(H\\subseteq\\lambda\\)</span> (candidate homogeneous set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homogeneous}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homogeneous}\\)</span> (canonical predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1ae7c37b2bb25594\" href=\"?note=1ae7c37b2bb25594\" title=\"58-df-homogeneous\">58-df-homogeneous</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RamseyHomogeneous}\">\\(\\operatorname{RamseyHomogeneous}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> 为类缩写，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^n\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=n\\}\">\\([A]^n\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=n\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，基数函数使用上述内部定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{RamseyHomogeneous}(H,c,n,q,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land\\mathrm{Homogeneous}(H,c,\\lambda,n,q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{RamseyHomogeneous}(H,c,n,q,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land\\mathrm{Homogeneous}(H,c,\\lambda,n,q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The color value is quantified in the declared codomain of the coloring.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-homogeneous","status":"resolved","id":"1ae7c37b2bb25594","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homogeneous]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homogeneous","status":"resolved","id":"1ae7c37b2bb25594","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homogeneous}$ (canonical predicate, see [[58-df-homogeneous]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 $\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$，$\\mathrm{Card}$ 为类缩写，见 [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 $\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$，$\\mathrm{Card}$ 为类缩写，见 [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n,q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Card}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in q^{[\\lambda]^n}","display":false},{"tex":"H\\subseteq\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homogeneous}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RamseyHomogeneous}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Card}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^n\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}ramsey\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{RamseyHomogeneous}(H,c,n,q,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land\\mathrm{Homogeneous}(H,c,\\lambda,n,q)","display":true}],"bytes":1456,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1718","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-comb8-ramsey-homogeneous-set.md|58-df-zfc-comb8-ramsey-homogeneous-set]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["1ae7c37b2bb25594","2be08d4ee8aa1590","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}